                    Designed and simulated a solar panel battery charging
                    system using the Perturb and Observe (P&O) MPPT
                    technique to extract maximum available power for
                    lighting applications.
                </p>
                <p>
                    <strong>Focus:</strong> Solar energy, voltage and
                    current sensing, DC-DC conversion and battery charging.
                </p>
