                    to monitor parameters such as voltage, current,
                    temperature and sunlight intensity.
                </p>
                <p>
                    <strong>Focus:</strong> Sensor interfacing,
                    microcontrollers and remote monitoring.
                </p>
            </article>

            <article class="project-card">
